  "bodyText": "Skip to content\nTotal items in cart: 0\nSWEET PINEAPPLE\n1 Bottle\n$9.49 CAD\nSkip to product information\n1\n2\n3\nSWEET PINEAPPLE\n$9.49 CAD\n\nThis is a demonstration store. You can purchase products like this from Bachan's.\n\nGreat as a sauce or marinade on meat, fish, veggies, rice & anything in-between!\n\nWhy didn’t we think of this sooner? Pineapple and Bachan’s is the delicious combination you never saw coming but was always meant to be. Our Sweet Pineapple Japanese Barbecue Sauce is made with pineapple for the perfect hit of tropical brightness and light sweetness. Some say pineapple is a natural meat tenderizer so go ahead and use it as a marinade – we do. Call it a sweet little bonus. \n\nAt Bachan’s, we keep our promise to keep it real. Our crave-worthy flavor always comes from simple, clean ingredients.  And we cold-fill every bottle to eliminate the need for preservatives, additives or  flavorings. Now let’s eat! Itadakimasu!\n\n16.5oz (468g)\n\nBottle Pack Size\n1 Bottle\n2 Bottles\n3 Bottles\n6 Bottles\nDECREASE QUANTITY\nINCREASE QUANTITY\nADD TO CART\nBUY IT NOW\nSweet Honey\n\nSWEET HONEY\n\n$9.49 CAD\n\nSmooth & sweet, with organic golden honey\n\nThe Original\n\nTHE ORIGINAL\n\n$9.49 CAD\n\nBold, fresh and filled with umami flavor\n\nHalf Gallon\n\nHALF GALLON\n\n$44.99 CAD\n\nMore of our original family recipe\n\nThe Sweet Heat Gift Box\n\nTHE SWEET HEAT GIFT BOX\n\n$32.99 CAD\n\nThe best of both worlds— sweet and spicy\n\nMiso\n\nMISO\n\n$9.49 CAD\n\nBold & savory, with red and white miso\n\nSweet & Spicy\n\nSWEET & SPICY\n\n$9.99 CAD\n\nCreamy, Savory, and Umami with a Kick\n\nSHOP\nBarbecue\nDipping\nGifts\nMerch\nASK\nShipping\nReturns\nFAQ\nAbout us\nCONNECT\nContact us\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTikTok\nWE SEND TASTY EMAILS\nEmail\n© 2026 Savor, Powered by Shopify"
